            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, nikainua macho yangu tena, nikaona, na tazama, gombo la chuo lirukalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaniuliza, Unaona nini? Nikajibu, Naona gombo la chuo lirukalo; na urefu wake ni dhiraa ishirini, na upana wake dhiraa kumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
